          <a href="#" class="service text-center">
            <span class="icon flaticon-house"></span>
            <h2 class="service-heading">User-Friendly</h2>
            <p>Offer a seamless and intuitive user experience on your website. Ensure that visitors can easily navigate through property listings, filter search results, and find relevant information. A user-friendly interface enhances customer satisfaction and encourages users to spend more time exploring the available properties, ultimately increasing the likelihood of finding their ideal home or investment.</p>
            <p><span class="read-more">Read More</span></p>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <a href="#" class="service text-center">
            <span class="icon flaticon-sold"></span>
            <h2 class="service-heading">Comprehensive Property Listings</h2>
            <p>Provide an extensive and up-to-date database of property listings. Include high-quality images, detailed descriptions, virtual tours, and any relevant information that potential buyers or renters may need. By offering comprehensive details about each property, you demonstrate transparency and help clients make informed decisions. This transparency builds trust and credibility, setting your website apart from others in the real estate market.</p>
            <p><span class="read-more">Read More</span></p>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <a href="#" class="service text-center">
            <span class="icon flaticon-camera"></span>
            <h2 class="service-heading">Customer Support and Security</h2>
            <p>Stand out by offering excellent customer support and personalized assistance throughout the property search and transaction process. Implement chat support, responsive email services, or even a dedicated helpline to address client queries promptly. Additionally, consider integrating AI-driven tools or live chat features that can provide instant responses to frequently asked questions. </p>
            <p><span class="read-more">Read More</span></p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


